  },
  "note": "Revision 2 (2026-09-29). One file, four views: every element carries \"view\" (changes, review, model, evidence; review-suspect is a state of review and is not counted). Filter by view before counting words or checking overlap. \"changes\" is the launch view (Changes inbox, scope Baseline). Model and Evidence lay out the shell and their tab strips only; their content regions belong to other aspects and are not laid out, so their counts are partial (\"complete\": false). \"words_by_view\" overrides \"words\" where a slot label differs by view. \"selected\" marks a selected fill, counted as a container. \"interactive\" marks a text-role element that is operable (bare button or link). Word convention: every visible token counts, including a count placeholder n, which renders as one number. Values are a design, not a build: PREDICTION for a built page. The extra fields are additive to eija.layout.v1.",
